  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Human Trafficking Protection Mechanisms across the North Pacific</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will contribute to the North Pacific&apos;s efforts to effectively counter human trafficking and strengthen the protection of trafficked persons and vulnerable migrants. This objective will be achieved by enhancing the governments&apos; capacity for victim identification and institutionalizing protection based on international standards and best practices.</narrative>
  </description>
